    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/bd6a9de0ab9f8435fa56f4fff292ef33.avif?t=1751688218\" data-has-big width=800 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Into the Fold-Nala Junction</strong> is a fast-paced  short horror  in which you fight, shoot, rip, and run for your life- 90s-style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d2f32438c61926199525607a70bf2123.poster.avif?t=1751688218\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d2f32438c61926199525607a70bf2123.webm?t=1751688218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/d2f32438c61926199525607a70bf2123.mp4?t=1751688218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Into the Fold - Nala Junction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You came to document a remote mountain retreat near a quiet, secluded village with a secret no one talks about. It should have been simple: observe, record, and leave.\u00a0Now the night won\u2019t end, and it keeps calling, and they will do anything to keep it a secret.   <br>But the old train near Nala Junction may be your only way out. Catch it before they catch you</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an abandoned, isolated retreat</strong> tangled in ritual.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect corrupted tapes and documents</strong> to uncover what they  truly want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run and fight</strong>: Use weapons, no stealth, no mercy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light parkour: </strong>Escape before they catch you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-building sense of dread<br>  </p></li></ul>",
